      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ideally, we should try to understand why this is happening in this CL since I think we\u0027re still discussing the next CL.\n\nI\u0027d say we should try to determine:\n- When does this callback actually fire? Is it after the code calls setUids in line 4679, or is it before that?\n- Are the capabilities different from the previous capabilities, or are they duplicates? If different, how? \n- Are we sending a NetworkCapabilities update with an empty set of UID ranges to a caller that should not get that update, because those ranges don\u0027t cover the caller\u0027s UID? That would be a bug.",
